## 4. DESIGN SYSTEM (keep all 6 slides identical in style)

- **Background:** near-black `#05070A`. Panels/cards `#0E1A15`.
- **Text:** off-white `#E8F3EC`. Muted labels `#5F7A6C`.
- **Accents — use consistently, they carry meaning:**
  - Lime `#7DFFB0` = evidence found / positive / granted
  - Amber `#F0A839` = the 2005 cutoff / caution / pending
  - Coral `#FF6A4D` = rejected / problem
- **Fonts:** headings **Chivo** (or Montserrat), data/labels **JetBrains Mono** (or Consolas). Two fonts only.
- **Rules:** one original graphic per slide · no paragraph longer than 2 lines · no clip-art · no emoji as icons (draw simple line icons) · big numbers get big type.

