- [ ] ≥1 original graphic per slide
- [ ] Slide 3 has the 2×2 matrix **and** the PS-compliance ribbon
- [ ] Slide 4 has the decade strip, the breakpoint chart, the confidence dial, and the three honest-limit chips
- [ ] Slide 5 screenshots are labelled "illustrative demo data"
- [ ] Slide 6 accuracy figures are labelled **targets**
- [ ] The word "proves" appears **nowhere**

**Compliance**
- [ ] No college name, member names, photos, or roll numbers anywhere
- [ ] Team ID field handled per SPOC confirmation
- [ ] Exported as **PDF**
- [ ] PDF metadata scrubbed (`exiftool -all= deck.pdf`)
- [ ] Uploaded to the Google Form before **21 Aug**

**Comprehension test (do this — it is the best predictor of the score)**
- [ ] Hand the PDF to two people outside the team. Give them **90 seconds**. Ask each to state, in one sentence, (a) what the project does and (b) what makes it different. If either cannot, simplify Slide 3 and Slide 4 — do not add more text.

